# Database Architecture

```mermaid
erDiagram
    EVENT {
        uuid id PK
        datetime event_time
        string source
        string source_type
        string category
        string subcategory
        string priority
        string status
        string sender
        string receiver
        string title
        text message
        uuid incident_id FK
        string correlation_id
        float latitude
        float longitude
        string operator
        string device
        string audio_path
        string video_path
        string image_path
        text metadata_json
        string ai_summary
        float ai_confidence
        boolean is_acknowledged
        boolean is_deleted
        int version
        datetime created_at
        datetime updated_at
    }

    INCIDENT {
        uuid id PK
        string title
        string status
        string priority
        datetime created_at
        datetime updated_at
    }

    SOURCE {
        uuid id PK
        string name
        string type
        boolean is_active
        datetime last_seen
    }

    ATTACHMENT {
        uuid id PK
        uuid event_id FK
        string file_type
        string file_path
        datetime created_at
    }

    ALERT {
        uuid id PK
        uuid event_id FK
        string alert_type
        string severity
        boolean is_acknowledged
        datetime created_at
    }

    PLUGIN {
        uuid id PK
        string plugin_id
        string name
        string version
        boolean is_active
        datetime registered_at
        datetime last_heartbeat
    }

    EVENT ||--o{ ATTACHMENT : has
    EVENT ||--o{ ALERT : generates
    EVENT ||--o| INCIDENT : linked_to
    INCIDENT ||--o{ EVENT : contains
```

## Repository Pattern

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph Service
        S[EventService]
    end

    subgraph Repository
        BR[BaseRepository]
        ER[EventRepository]
    end

    subgraph Database
        Session[(Session)]
        Engine[(Engine)]
    end

    S --> ER
    ER --> BR
    BR --> Session
    Session --> Engine

    style BR fill:#e1f5fe
    style ER fill:#c8e6c9
```

## Connection Management

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph Engine["SQLAlchemy Engine"]
        URL[(Database URL)]
        Pool[Connection Pool]
        PrePing[Pool Pre-Ping]
    end

    subgraph Session["Session Factory"]
        Maker[SessionMaker]
        AutoFlush[autoflush=False]
        AutoCommit[autocommit=False]
    end

    URL --> Engine
    Engine --> Pool
    Pool --> PrePing
    PrePing --> Maker
    Maker --> Session
```
